msgid "Served by GNOME Remote Desktop VNC (port 5900); exposure follows GNOME Settings > Sharing"
msgstr "Streže GNOME Remote Desktop VNC (vrata 5900); izpostavljenost sledi Nastavitvam GNOME > Souporaba"

